     [38;5;246mSurvives page reloads and navigation within the tab; cleared when the tab closes. Matches a login session's natural
[39m     [38;5;246mlifetime.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m In-memory only
     [38;5;246mA module variable, lost on refresh or new tab. Simplest and no storage surface, but multi-page flows lose the id.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m localStorage
     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restart and is shared across tabs. Longest-lived, but leaves a user identifier on the machine [39m
     [38;5;246muntil explicitly cleared.[39m
